/05/29/1722656/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"想像つかんけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女優さんになれてたらいいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃはきのこの山とたけのこの里、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっち派ですか～！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/29/1722656/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔はきのこだったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たけのこの魅力に気づいて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はたけのこ派です笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺もコメント書くときマリ茶(まりちゃ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってかいてるけど、このあだ名は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃ的にどう:>？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/29/1722656/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、メンバーではかなだけに呼ばれてるのが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、すき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/29/1722656/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも写真撮るの上手いな～って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"は思ってたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"専属カメラマンでもいるの？www"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/29/1722656/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服とかはパパやママやメンバー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達に撮ってもらってるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/29/1722656/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46の歌の中で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どの振り付けが一番好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/29/1722656/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐるぐるカーテンのサビ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左胸の勇気の間奏"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハウス！の間奏"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼に口笛をの間奏"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...本当は全部すきだけどね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/29/1722656/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京スカイツリーとかも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行った? or 行ってみたい?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/29/1722656/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ行ったことない‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一度行ってみたい‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間がないせいかコメントを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書くのが雑になりがち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脱字や誤字が多過ぎて反省ばかり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかたん、それでも俺のコメント"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/29/1722656/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部読んでます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間ない中、いつもコメント"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読むだけで